            <description><![CDATA[<html><body style="font-family:-apple-system,sans-serif"><h3>SkySaver 0.2.2</h3><ul><li>Added native sounds: birds, crickets, rain and thunder</li><li>Added a notification when an update is ready</li><li>Added news cards for previews of new scenes</li><li>Added wallpaper that starts faster at login</li><li>Added a still sky that stays when the Mac powers off</li><li>Added opening the sky window from the app icon</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
